From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ImmortalWrt DTU <firmware@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] usb: serial: option: support Tastek IT-694 modem

The IT-694 modem exposes a Marvell composite device with USB ID
1286:4e3c.  Its vendor-specific interfaces provide the AT and diagnostic
ports and must be handled by the option driver.

---
 drivers/usb/serial/option.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/usb/serial/option.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/serial/option.c
@@ -1170,6 +1170,8 @@ static const struct usb_device_id option
 	{ USB_DEVICE_AND_INTERFACE_INFO(MEIGLINK_VENDOR_ID, MEIGLINK_PRODUCT_SLM828, USB_CLASS_VENDOR_SPEC, 0x10, 0x03) },
 	{ USB_DEVICE_AND_INTERFACE_INFO(MEIGLINK_VENDOR_ID, MEIGLINK_PRODUCT_SLM828, USB_CLASS_VENDOR_SPEC, 0x10, 0x04) },
+	/* Tastek IT-694 / Marvell Mobile Composite Device Bus */
+	{ USB_DEVICE(0x1286, 0x4e3c) },
 	/* Quectel products using Qualcomm vendor ID */
 	{ USB_DEVICE(QUALCOMM_VENDOR_ID, QUECTEL_PRODUCT_UC15)},
 	{ USB_DEVICE(QUALCOMM_VENDOR_ID, QUECTEL_PRODUCT_UC20),
